rd, Sierrita, and Miami in Arizona; Chino and Tyrone in New Mexico; and Henderson and Climax in Colorado, North America, as well as Cerro Verde in Peru and El Abra in Chile. The company was formerly known as Freeport-McMoRan Copper & Gold Inc. and changed its name to Freeport-McMoRan Inc. in July 2014. The company was incorporated in 1987 and is headquartered in Phoenix, Arizona.","ceo_bio":"Ms. Kathleen Lynne Quirk | CEO, President & Director | Age 61 | Compensation: $3.0M (FY2025)","culture_narrative":"Employs approximately 29K people. Revenue per employee of $894K ranks in the top quartile among Basic Materials peers. Each employee generates $38K of free cash flow annually. Stock-based compensation of $4K per employee reflects an ownership culture. CEO compensation is 3\u00d7 revenue per employee (modest relative to workforce productivity). Governance score flags low compensation governance risk (2/10).","financial_summary":["Freeport-McMoRan, Inc. is a large-cap basic materials business with a $66.0B market cap on $25.9B of annual revenue.","The top line has compounded at +4% over the past three years and +5% annually across the full decade, which puts it in mature, slow-growth territory.","Returns on capital run at 21% against a 11% cost of capital \u2014 a 11-point spread that is the clearest signature of an economic moat.","The business throws off $1.1B in free cash flow \u2014 roughly 4 cents on every revenue dollar, which is the owner-earnings figure that actually belongs to shareholders, and cash conversion sits at 2.55\u00d7 so those profits are backed by real cash.","On the balance sheet, leverage is comfortably conservative at 0.6\u00d7 net debt/EBITDA, and interest coverage of 25\u00d7 is fortress-like.","Shareholder yield is only 1.5%, a thin return of capital, and insider ownership is negligible, so management has little personal stake in the long-term outcome, and within its sector the business captures 1.9\u00d7 its fair share of profits, a structural advantage visible in the numbers."],"sector_headwinds":[{"text":"Price sits 358% above estimated fair value \u2014 no margin of safety left, and the cushion against estimate error has been bid away (confirmed by 1 other valuation measure)","sev":"red","cat":"valuation","magnitude":3.5777875780199055},{"text":"Volatile returns on capital suggest the moat is narrower than a snapshot ROIC implies","sev":"amber","cat":"moat"},{"text":"Altman Z in the grey zone \u2014 financial health warrants monitoring","sev":"amber","cat":"quality"},{"text":"Insiders are net sellers (100% sell ratio, net $8.4M) \u2014 the people closest to the business are reducing their personal stake","sev":"amber","cat":"insider"},{"text":"Basic Materials ETF trading well below its long-term trend","sev":"amber","cat":"sector"},{"text":"Cyclical sectors like Basic Materials tend to underperform in slowdowns","sev":"amber","cat":"sector"},{"text":"Weakness in commodity prices pressures materials companies","sev":"amber","cat":"sector"},{"text":"High market volatility with VIX at 36, signaling elevated fear","sev":"amber","cat":"macro"},{"text":"Widening credit spreads suggest growing stress in corporate debt markets","sev":"amber","cat":"macro"},{"text":"Trade policy and tariff whiplash \u2014 materials producers are first-order casualties of protectionist swings, and margin gets squeezed from both input and output pricing.","sev":"amber","cat":"thesis_risk"}],"sector_tailwinds":["Reinvestment rate supports 11% organic growth capacity \u2014 capital is compounding inside the business","Operating margins 16% above sector median \u2014 the quantitative trace of pricing power","Trading near the bottom of its 52-week range \u2014 the market is offering a discount","Healthy payout ratio leaves room for both dividend growth and reinvestment","ROIC sits in the top quartile of Basic Materials peers \u2014 the moat is wider than the neighbourhood"],"news_headlines":[{"title":"Is Freeport-McMoRan (NYSE:FCX) Entering A New Strategic Chapter?","source":"kalkinemedia.com","link":"https://kalkinemedia.com/us/stocks/metal-and-mining/is-freeport-mcmoran-nysefcx-entering-a-new-strategic-chapter","date":"2026-11-20","timestamp":1795204740.0,"origin":"tiingo","sentiment":0.0,"tier":0,"scope":"company","tags":[]},{"title":"Freeport McMoRan (FCX) Stock Looks Like A Bargain After A Sharp Selloff","source":"finance.yahoo.com","link":"https://finance.yahoo.com/markets/stocks/articles/freeport-mcmoran-fcx-stock-looks-101002663.html","date":"2026-11-20","timestamp":1795169402.0,"origin":"tiingo","sentiment":0.935,"tier":0,"scope":"company","tags":[]},{"title":"Freeport McMoRan (FCX) Lost A Major Hedge Fund Holder","source":"finance.yahoo.com","link":"https://finance.yahoo.com/markets/commodities/articles/freeport-mcmoran-fcx-lost-major-071542084.html","date":"2026-11-20","timestamp":1795158942.0,"origin":"tiingo","sentiment":-0.402,"tier":0,"scope":"company","tags":[]},{"title":"How Is the Grasberg Restart Plan Shaping Freeport-McMoRan (NYSE:FCX)?","source":"kalkinemedia.com","link":"https://kalkinemedia.com/us/stocks/metal-and-mining/how-is-the-grasberg-restart-plan-shaping-freeport-mcmoran-nysefcx","date":"2026-11-20","timestamp":1795155000.0,"origin":"tiingo","sentiment":-0.128,"tier":0,"scope":"company","tags":[]},{"title":"Stocks Sink as Tech Rout Deepens","source":"finance.yahoo.com","link":"https://finance.yahoo.com/markets/stocks/articles/stocks-sink-tech-rout-deepens-162309440.html","date":"2026-11-20","timestamp":1795191789.0,"origin":"tiingo","sentiment":0.0,"tier":2,"scope":"company","tags":[]},{"title":"Global Stocks Retreat on Unwind of the AI Trade","source":"finance.yahoo.com","link":"https://finance.yahoo.com/markets/stocks/articles/global-stocks-retreat-unwind-ai-150548809.html","date":"2026-11-20","timestamp":1795187148.0,"origin":"tiingo","sentiment":0.202,"tier":2,"scope":"company","tags":[]},{"title":"US Stock Market Today: S&P 500 Futures Slip As Higher Rate 